    "text": "The resistive network shown below is connected to a <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>.</mo></math> source of <math><mn>16</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The power consumed by the network is <math><mn>4</mn></math> Watt. The value of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math> is:<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b771ee9a-0eb6-4af1-8e8d-64d598e0c4ee-image14.png\" />",
